            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>Cadence設計系統(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:CDNS:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/CDNS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">CDNS-US</a>)截至台北時間31日01:46股價下跌17.24美元，報325.51美元，跌幅5.03%，成交量806,795（股），盤中最高價337.98美元、最低價325.51美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-1.05%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-2.02%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-3.17%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-8.34%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>Cadence設計系統(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:CDNS:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/CDNS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">CDNS-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：+10.69%</li> <li>近 1 月：+5.73%</li> <li>近 3 月：+3%</li> <li>近 6 月：+3.88%</li> <li>今年以來：+9.65%</li></ul></section></main>",
